abstract: >-
  Code, protocols, raw results and verifiers for a series of 20 research
  campaigns on functional causal organization, including PCI_T (a perturbational
  complexity index for transformers and its directional specificity),
  FCA-Bench (a functional causal access benchmark with behavioral and causal
  profiles) and a causal-organization profile (Gamma, Delta, R, Lambda),
  applied to Qwen3-8B. Code under MIT; data, results and
  documentation under CC BY 4.0.
keywords:
  - language models
  - interpretability
  - perturbational complexity
  - functional access
  - benchmark
